        "id": 1572468
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-11T15:43:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shouldn\u0027t we hold this during the notification so that concurrent FFA_PARTITION_INFO_GET doesn\u0027t mess with the `sp_ids` array?",
