        "id": 1572468
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-11T15:43:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s stronger than that: we should only send the creation message if an SP has asked for it and we should only send the destruction message has asked for it too. So you may need to store a couple of bits per SP.",
      "parentUuid": "ea7cc69e_ef9a638e",
